      "source": "Determine the actual class for the given bean definition, as instantiated at runtime.",
      "translation": "确定给定 Bean 定义的实际类，即在运行时实例化时的类。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Subclasses can override this method, which is implemented to throw\nUnsupportedOperationException, if they can instantiate an object with\nthe Method Injection specified in the given RootBeanDefinition.",
      "translation": "子类可以重写此方法，如果它们能够根据给定的 RootBeanDefinition 中指定的方法注入实例化一个对象，则该方法被实现为抛出 UnsupportedOperationException。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
      "source": "Subclasses can override this method, which is implemented to throw\nUnsupportedOperationException, if they can instantiate an object with\nthe Method Injection specified in the given RootBeanDefinition.\nInstantiation should use a no-arg constructor.",
      "translation": "子类可以重写此方法，如果它们能够根据给定的 RootBeanDefinition 中指定的方法注入实例化一个对象，则该方法实现为抛出 UnsupportedOperationException。实例化应使用无参构造函数。",
      "count": 2
    },
    {
